Association StudentIEPAccommodationCollection
    documentation "The accommodations prescribed to a student as part of their IEP."
    domain entity EdFi.Student
        documentation "A reference to the student."
    domain entity EdFi.EducationOrganization
        documentation "The identifier assigned to the education organization (usually District/LEA) providing IEP Services."
    domain entity StudentIEP
        documentation "The student IEP for which the accommodations are prescribed."
        is part of identity
        merge StudentIEP.Student with Student
        merge StudentIEP.EducationOrganization with EducationOrganization
    descriptor EdFi.Accommodation
        documentation "The special variation(s) to be used in how various services (in general) are presented, how they are administered, or how the student is allowed to respond. This generally refers to changes that do not substantially alter the content that the service renders. The proper use of accommodations does not substantially change academic level or performance criteria."
        is required collection